      "locked": false,
      "text": "## systemd - counting\n\n[Unit]\nDescription=Consul Demo Counting Service\nAfter=network.target\n\n[Service]\nType=simple\nUser=counting-user\nGroup=counting-user\nWorkingDirectory=/opt/counting\nEnvironment=\"PORT=3000\"\nExecStart=/opt/counting/counting-service\nRestart=always\nRestartSec=5\n\n[Install]\nWantedBy=multi-user.target",
      "fontSize": 19.412108564477077,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "## systemd - counting\n\n[Unit]\nDescription=Consul Demo Counting Service\nAfter=network.target\n\n[Service]\nType=simple\nUser=counting-user\nGroup=counting-user\nWorkingDirectory=/opt/counting\nEnvironment=\"PORT=3000\"\nExecStart=/opt/counting/counting-service\nRestart=always\nRestartSec=5\n\n[Install]\nWantedBy=multi-user.target",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
